    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math> is :",
