    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
